ta-end="1136">可用磷（2% 柠檬酸溶解度）：</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1144" data-end="1155">结果</strong> 99%</p></li><li data-start="1162" data-end="1209"><p data-start="1164" data-end="1209"><strong data-start="1164" data-end="1181">钙 (Ca)：</strong> ≥20% | <strong data-start="1189" data-end="1200">结果</strong> 22.27%</p></li><li data-start="1210" data-end="1258"><p data-start="1212" data-end="1258"><strong data-start="1212" data-end="1229">氟 (F)：</strong> ≤0.18% | <strong data-start="1239" data-end="1250">结果</strong> 0.15%</p></li><li data-start="1259" data-end="1309"><p data-start="1261" data-end="1309"><strong data-start="1261" data-end="1278">砷（As）：</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1289" data-end="1300">结果</strong> 13 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1310" data-end="1356"><p data-start="1312" data-end="1356"><strong data-start="1312" data-end="1326">铅 (Pb)：</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1337" data-end="1348">结果</strong> 7 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1357" data-end="1408"><p data-start="1359" data-end="1408"><strong data-start="1359" data-end="1376">镉 (Cd)：</strong> ≤10 ppm | <strong data-start="1387" data-end="1398">结果</strong> 百万分之 1.3</p></li><li data-start="1409" data-end="1465"><p data-start="1411" data-end="1465"><strong data-start="1411" data-end="1442">pH 值（2.4 克/升水溶液）：</strong> &gt;7 | <strong data-start="1448" data-end="1459">结果</strong> 7.5</p></li><li data-start="1466" data-end="1504"><p data-start="1468" data-end="1504"><strong data-start="1468" data-end="1481">湿度</strong> ≤4% | <strong data-start="1488" data-end="1499">结果</strong> 1%</p></li><li data-start="1505" data-end="1564"><p data-start="1507" data-end="1564"><strong data-start="1507" data-end="1539">粒度（通过 500 μm）：</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1547" data-end="1558">结果</strong> 95%</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1566" data-end="1569" /><h3 data-start="980" data-end="1022"><img src="/images/uploads/2025/09/DCP18-Powder-4-300x300.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp